Same sealed AArch64 image as musl-reference-boundaries.out; GCC14.2/Clang19.1.7.
Native references: -O0/-O2 -frounding-math -ffp-contract=off; EvoCC uses the
existing no-contraction RNE profile. No host floating arithmetic supplies the
expected results. Raw commands and outputs:
