Disposition: the two observed strtold failures are explained by the pinned
library algorithm, not an EvoCC-only arithmetic/lowering defect. The unchanged
original tests still FAIL on both archives. Changing library source/version or
test expectations requires an explicitly declared new benchmark configuration;
it must not rewrite the original FAIL as PASS. B08d full acceptance remains open.
